# backups and incident evidence (docs/tech/15-cicd-deployment.md §8, 12-security.md §9.3): the
# encrypted dump is an artifact, never a commit, and evidence exports stay beside the incident
# record without entering history. The record itself (docs/incidents/*.md) is tracked.
